# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Design:** the decision this requirement implements is [ADR 0003 - One MCP surface per provider, and a disposition for every role](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md). That record holds the architecture, the metadata contract, the identity and discovery rules, the safety contract, and the exhaustive per-role audit. This document holds the user story, the acceptance criteria, and the order of work."
