# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Also manually dispatchable: `cron-images-mirror-all.yml`, `cron-images-cleanup-ci.yml`, `cron-cleanup-stale.yml`, `cron-update.yml`, `cron-release-highest.yml`, `call-release-version.yml`, `call-lint.yml`, `call-test.yml`, `call-test-dns.yml`, `call-test-workspace.yml`, `call-test-runner-smoke.yml`."
msgstr "ส่งได้ด้วยตนเอง: `cron-images-mirror-all.yml`. `cron-images-cleanup-ci.yml`. `cron-cleanup-stale.yml`. `cron-update.yml`. `cron-release-highest.yml`. `call-release-version.yml`. `call-lint.yml`. `call-test.yml`. `call-test-dns.yml`. `call-test-workspace.yml`. `call-test-runner-smoke.yml`."

