msgid "When to skip the rule: narrow globs that hit a fixed small set of paths (e.g. `roles_dir.glob(\"*/meta/services.yml\")`) do not benefit meaningfully; walks inside an isolated `tempfile.TemporaryDirectory()` fixture are out of scope because the cache is read-only by design. Even in those cases, use `utils.cache.files.read_text` for individual file contents so other tests reading the same path get a cache hit."
