# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With ``services.litellm.enabled``, ``templates/LocalSettings.php.j2`` loads ``VisualEditor`` (bundled in the image), ``VisualEditorPlus`` and ``AIEditingAssistant``, then points the extension’s ``open-ai`` provider at the in-cluster gateway:"
