msgid "[031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) made [`svc-ai-litellm`](../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/) the single place model backends are wired, and consumers now carry a gateway URL plus a model alias. That moved the wiring, not the choice: every consumer still names one alias, and `LITELLM_CHAT_MODEL` in [16_ai.yml](../../group_vars/all/16_ai.yml) resolves it once per deploy for everyone."
