# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] A test discovers every role with a literal `application_id` and proves that it appears exactly once as `native_server`, `native_client`, `native_both`, `plugin_server`, `sidecar_server`, `adapter_server`, `adapter_candidate`, `blocked`, `enabler`, `subordinate`, or `no_surface`; absence is not an audit result."
