msgid "[x] TLS termination, certificate handling (Let's Encrypt + project CA stack via `sys-front-tls-*`), and all `sys-front-inj-*` snippets continue to operate inside openresty unchanged. Compose and Swarm modes differ only in how the backend port is reached, not in how the response is rewritten — the `body_filter.lua` pipeline (CSP-meta stripping, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout snippet injection) is byte-for-byte identical across modes."
