msgid "`mechanism` (required) MUST be one of `addon`, `plugin`, `mu_plugin`, `extension`, `module`, `bridge`. It records the upstream installation mechanism and selects which task path installs the addon. `mechanism: bridge` denotes a network/appservice bridge addon (see Confirmed Decision 13) and is distinct from the `bridges:` field below."
